{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.15, "data": {"request_id": "87dc7914bda9", "seq": 25, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:59.565Z", "t_ms": 7147, "delta": " an agent's ability to keep learning is addressed under the evaluation dimension titled the **ability to evolve continually** [C2"}}
