{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.564, "data": {"request_id": "87dc7914bda9", "seq": 27, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:59.979Z", "t_ms": 7562, "delta": " learning:** Evaluated across three specific criteria:\n  1. The overall performance on all tasks learned up to the present ["}}
