{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.943, "data": {"request_id": "87dc7914bda9", "seq": 29, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:02:00.358Z", "t_ms": 7940, "delta": "  3. Learning plasticity when acquiring new tasks [C5].\n* **Autotelic learning ability:** Evaluates"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.129, "data": {"request_id": "87dc7914bda9", "seq": 30, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:02:00.544Z", "t_ms": 8126, "delta": " the agent’s capacity to autonomously set and pursue its own goals within open-world settings by exploring the unknown and acquiring new"}}
