{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.665, "data": {"request_id": "87dc7914bda9", "seq": 33, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:02:01.080Z", "t_ms": 8662, "delta": " agents can transfer previously acquired knowledge, capabilities, and skills to accomplish tasks in unfamiliar settings [C5]. The survey recommends evaluating this using unseen"}}
